OL,3,GNEWSABoxing and wrestling plan for
OL,4,AVictorian railway shed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA students' union has applied for a
OL,7,Flicence to stage boxing and wrestling
OL,8,Fevents in a Victorian railway shed.
OL,10,FBucks Students' Union wants to host the
OL,11,Fevents at the Grade II* listed Brunel
OL,12,FEngine Shed in High Wycombe,
OL,13,FBuckinghamshire, alongside other indoor
OL,14,Fsports, as well as live music, dancing
OL,15,Fand theatre.
OL,17,FThe shed was built for the Great
OL,18,FWestern Railway by its chief engineer,
OL,19,FIsambard Kingdom Brunel, and had fallen
OL,20,Finto disrepair before it was restored
OL,21,Fby Wycombe District Council in 2023.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
