OL,3,GNEWSABoxing and wrestling plan for
OL,4,AVictorian railway shed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe application describes the building
OL,7,Fas a year-round events venue, with
OL,8,Fspace for seated or standing audiences
OL,9,Fof up to 500 people.
